    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "When tests share the same **target module** and **assertion shape**, prefer a **named case table** (`pytest.mark.parametrize` or dataclass table) over separate test functions, unless separate functions encode materially different setup, contract, or regression history.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-5",
      "type": "heading",
